; Chart of accounts (ADR 0017). Copied to data/books/ by `qp books init`; edit your copy.
; Categories are Expenses/Income accounts (one per transaction); use #tags for projects.
; Close an account with `YYYY-MM-DD close Account` instead of deleting its line.

; ---------------------------------------------------------------- assets: cash
2026-10-01 open Assets:Bank:KuveytTurk            TRY   ; cari hesap
2026-10-01 open Assets:Bank:VakifKatilim          TRY
2026-10-01 open Assets:Bank:Akbank                TRY
2026-10-01 open Assets:Wallet:Papara              TRY
2026-10-01 open Assets:Bank:RevolutUS             USD
2026-10-01 open Assets:Cash:Wallet                TRY   ; cash in hand

; ---------------------------------------------------------------- assets: investments
; Valued by qp's portfolio once the broker ledger is imported (qp_account links them);
; otherwise shown at the net amount transferred.
2026-10-01 open Assets:Investments:Midas
  qp_account: "MIDAS"
2026-10-01 open Assets:Investments:IBKR
  qp_account: "IBKR"
2026-10-01 open Assets:Investments:Other

; ---------------------------------------------------------------- assets: you add these
; 2026-10-01 open Assets:Property:Home             TRY
; 2026-10-01 open Assets:Vehicle:Car               TRY
; 2026-10-01 open Assets:Receivable:Loans          TRY   ; money lent to others

; ---------------------------------------------------------------- liabilities
; Add each credit card and loan you have, e.g.:
; 2026-10-01 open Liabilities:CreditCard:Akbank    TRY
; 2026-10-01 open Liabilities:CreditCard:KuveytTurk TRY
; 2026-10-01 open Liabilities:Loan:Car             TRY
2026-10-01 open Liabilities:Payable               TRY   ; money you owe people

; ---------------------------------------------------------------- equity
2026-10-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances
2026-10-01 open Equity:Conversions               ; currency exchange between own accounts

